OL,3,GNEWSAHeat and sun sparks 'supercharged'
OL,4,Awine year
OL,5,
OL,6,FOver a tonne of grapes from a
OL,7,FHerefordshire farm are crushing
OL,8,Fthemselves under their own weight in a
OL,9,Fmassive tank in Digbeth.
OL,11,FThey're producing enough juice for
OL,12,Fwine, and enough carbon dioxide to set
OL,13,Foff a small personal alarm clipped to
OL,14,Fthe belt of Richard Stenton, the wine
OL,15,Fmaker.
OL,17,F"Asphyxiation by CO2 is the leading
OL,18,Fcause of accidental death for
OL,19,Fwinemakers", he tells me. "That's why
OL,20,Fwe have the alarms."
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,353,350,200,160,0,100
